{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "46c1bd5a-eb3d-45c1-8f69-d43519001ee5",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3122",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sorry to bother you.",
                "zh": "不好意思打扰你一下。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 522.4000244140625,
            "positionY": 123.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ccc3d082-fa3e-4480-9b6a-74f0d8259f3e",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3123",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh, it’s fine. I’m not making any progress anyway…",
                "zh": "啊没事，反正我现在也没什么进展......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 856.0,
            "positionY": 124.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "955967f2-b8bc-4545-bbf7-0e621a136f2e",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3124",
            "content": {
                "en": "What are you trying to fix?",
                "zh": "请问您这是在修理什么呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1174.39990234375,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a3e1b533-373a-472c-b903-a1895c16e64a",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3125",
            "content": {
                "en": "It wasn’t supposed to be a repair job. They wanted to use a speaker to loop a sound effect next to their stall, and I just came to set up the program for them.",
                "zh": "本来不是修理的。这些人想要用印象在摊位旁边循环播放一个音效，我本来只是过来帮他们设定好程序的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1504.7999267578125,
            "positionY": 123.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "df9fdef7-338a-4cea-b528-280859ceee9a",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3126",
            "content": {
                "en": "But it looks like the hardware’s acting up, and now it won’t play properly. I’m still racking my brain over what to do.",
                "zh": "结果硬件好像出问题了，现在一直没法正常播放，我还在苦恼怎么办呢。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1837.5999755859375,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c4ee8103-eaa5-4b5f-84eb-9bd45f98ed39",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3127",
            "content": {
                "en": "What kind of sound effect?",
                "zh": "什么样的音效？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2172.800048828125,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a0211c76-ae8d-4fc8-aea3-94eaea1de085",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3128",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hmm, it’s a kind of strange drumbeat. Hard to describe.",
                "zh": "嗯，是种有点奇怪的鼓点，不太好描述。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2503.199951171875,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c33194f2-5996-4bdf-9b5e-9893325e0926",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3129",
            "content": {
                "en": "If we could fix the sound system, you could hear it yourself, but for now that’s probably not happening.",
                "zh": "要是能修好音响的话你就能直接听见了，但现在恐怕没办法了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2839.199951171875,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c8d5c82f-3f14-4f97-9c9e-9253e3c2df14",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3130",
            "content": {
                "en": "That’s okay. Thanks for telling me.",
                "zh": "没关系的，谢谢你告诉我这些。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3168.0,
            "positionY": 123.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
